      "content": "1.  839                                           HIGH STREET                                              (South Side)                                               Nos 163 &165 SP 9907 NW 1/32 II 2. C17 or earlier, altered.  2 buildings, taller on left, lower on right, both with tiled roofs, plaster 1st floor, modern ground floor shop windows. 2 storeys on left with 2 flush casements.  2 storeys and attic on right with Yorkshire casement, gabled Yorkshire casement dormer, both with glazing bars. Listing NGR: SP9918107794"
    }
